      "title": "How a decision is made",
      "items": [
        "Next.js rewrites /api/* to FastAPI, so no CORS is needed",
        "engines/ are pure and unit-tested; one validator serves every path"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Configured, not hardcoded",
      "items": [
        "13 rule types and blocks A-G are database rows, edited in Settings",
